gin="1:52.975" end="1:53.337">să-ți</span> <span begin="1:53.337" end="1:56.232">fie</span> <span begin="1:56.232" end="1:57.679">ție</span> <span begin="1:57.679" end="1:58.402">mai</span> <span begin="1:58.402" end="2:02.020">ușor!</span></p><p begin="2:02.020" end="2:13.597" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.020" end="2:02.744">Vei</span> <span begin="2:02.744" end="2:04.553">cânta</span> <span begin="2:04.553" end="2:04.914">la</span> <span begin="2:04.914" end="2:07.809">urmă,</span> <span begin="2:07.809" end="2:10.341">secerând</span> <span begin="2:10.341" end="2:13.597">ogorul!</span></p><p begin="2:13.597" end="2:23.003" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.597" end="2:15.768">Seamănă</span> <span begin="2:15.768" end="2:19.386">sămânța,</span> <span begin="2:19.386" end="2:20.109">brav</span> <span begin="2:20.109" end="2:23.003">semănător!</span></p></div></body></tt>